node_modules/
dist/
*.log

# Runtime data. The report archive is the archive of record, but it is imported
# from Docmost rather than authored here, so it is not committed. Fixtures used
# by tests live under test/fixtures/ and ARE committed.
data/reports/
data/state/
data/config.yaml
# The administrator's standing instructions — written by whoever runs the instance,
# about that instance. Never ours to commit.
data/context.md

.DS_Store
data/cache/
data/trials/
# The files an upload trial audits — somebody's working copy, never ours to commit.
data/uploads/
# The protocol's own history: snapshots of every revision of every rubric and script on
# THIS box. `data/protocols/*.md` are tracked; what an operator did to them is not ours.
data/protocols/.history/
